  "id": "hong-kong-championships",
  "name": "Hong Kong Championships",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "The Hong Kong Championships are part of the Championship Series run by Pokémon Asia. In 2023 they gave out Brilliant Stars' Ultra Ball with a 2023 Hong Kong Championships stamp, in plain, Staff, Top 8 and Champion versions. The English-speaking regions of the program, such as Singapore, Malaysia and the Philippines, used the same card as the International Championships, while regions with localized cards got other trophy cards. Hong Kong's 2023 event was run the same way as the Philippines', which had no junior or senior divisions, so its Champion copy may be one of a kind too.\n\nThe 2024 event gave Scarlet & Violet's Arven and a holo Paldea Evolved Chien-Pao ex, each with a Hong Kong Championships stamp.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Elite Fourum: Asia Championship Series, new English trophy card",
        "url": "https://www.elitefourum.com/t/asia-championship-series-new-english-trophy-card/41533"
      },
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: Brilliant Stars (TCG), additional cards",
        "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Brilliant_Stars_(TCG)#Additional_cards"
      },
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: Scarlet & Violet (TCG), additional cards",
        "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Scarlet_%26_Violet_(TCG)#Additional_Cards"
      },
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: Paldea Evolved (TCG), additional cards",
        "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Paldea_Evolved_(TCG)#Additional_Cards"
      }
    ]
  },
